-- the difference of intervals holds the difference X1/q1 − X2/q2
iv-sub-sound : (S : List Bool) → (I1 I2 : IV) → (X1 X2 : Nat × Nat) → (q1 q2 : Nat) → ivc I1 → ivc I2 → encl S I1 X1 q1 → encl S I2 X2 q2 → encl S (iv-sub I1 I2) (zplus (zsc X1 q2) (zsc (snd X2 , fst X2) q1)) (times q1 q2)
iv-sub-sound S I1 I2 X1 X2 q1 q2 c1 c2 e1 e2 = iv-add-sound S I1 (iv-neg I2) X1 (snd X2 , fst X2) q1 q2 c1 (iv-neg-canon I2 c2) e1 (iv-neg-sound S I2 X2 q2 e2)
